@host = http://127.0.0.1:5180
@token = PEGUE_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Estado de configuración inicial
GET {{host}}/api/setup/status

### Crear Administrador Maestro (solo primer inicio)
POST {{host}}/api/setup/master
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Administrador",
  "lastName": "BioVic",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Cambiar!2026",
  "confirmPassword": "Cambiar!2026",
  "email": null
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Cambiar!2026",
  "computerName": "PC-DEMO"
}

### Generar 20 equipos ficticios en Development
POST {{host}}/api/admin/demo/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Búsqueda con error ortográfico
GET {{host}}/api/equipment/search?q=monitr%20multiparametrco&page=1&pageSize=25

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Integridad de auditoría
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit/integrity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
